DTSTART:20260825T010000Z
DTEND:20260825T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260801T065413Z
UID:cb9c014c-e843-558a-81f7-212f66e84484
DESCRIPTION:When Silicon Valley says it is “moving fast and breaking thi
 ngs\,” the world interprets the chaos as a necessary cost of innovation.
  In his new book\, The Nerd Reich: Silicon Valley Fascism and the War on D
 emocracy\, Gil Durán argues that something far more sinister is at work: 
 a decades-long campaign to replace elected governments with corporate rule
 .\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-08-
 24/gil-duran-and-wajahat-ali-rise-nerd-reich
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, 110 The Embarcade
