BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Crossing the Wine-Dark Sea: Journeys Through Ancient Literature
DTSTART:20260902T220000Z
DTEND:20260903T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260801T065413Z
UID:93b9da26-7516-5f49-b37a-17e987744f45
DESCRIPTION:Emily Wilson\, whose translations of Homer’s Odyssey and Ili
 ad have captured a generation’s imagination\, joins us virtually to expl
 ore the complicated terrain of reading and writing about the ancient past.
  Drawing on 20 years of scholarship and teaching\, Wilson reviews the diff
 icult choices that translators must make\, the pleasures of finding new so
 lutions to old problems\, and the inevitable frustrations of never fully c
 apturing what is in the original work.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www
 .commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-02/crossing-wine-dark-sea-journeys-th
 rough-ancient-literature
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California
